    LineColor red
    BackgroundColor pink
    LineThickness 1
    ArrowThickness 1
    FontName Courier
    FontColor blue
    FontSize 10
    FontStyle italic
  }
}
</style>
:On the diamonds of the second if;
floating note
<b>All is good here... (like if the param will be global)
The BackgroundColor, the LineColor, the FontColor
end note
if (decision) then (yes)
    :C2;
else (no)
endif
